# ============================================================
#  .gitignore  -  files git should NEVER upload
# ============================================================

# THE MOST IMPORTANT ONE.
# Your config.ini holds your secret Gemini API key.
# If you upload it, strangers can use your key and your quota dies.
#
# We keep the blank template (config.example.ini) in git instead.
# When you set the app up you copy the template and rename it.
config.ini

# The Vosk model is 40 MB of other people's files. No point uploading it.
models/*
!models/README.txt

# Python's own junk
__pycache__/
*.pyc
*.pyo
.venv/
venv/
env/

# Our own log file
*.log

# Buddy's PERMANENT MEMORY - your personal facts, stored only on
# your own machine. This must NEVER be uploaded anywhere.
memory.db
